{"comment":"The conditional check for `IndexSettings.RECOVERY_USE_SYNTHETIC_SOURCE.isEnabled()` was removed along with its associated logic in multiple test cases. This simplifies the tests by removing the feature flag check and aligns with the technical map\u0027s intent to streamline the tests. However, this change introduces a risk if the feature flag is reintroduced or if there are other conditions that depend on it being checked. The removal of the conditional branch could lead to missed edge cases where `_recovery_source` should not be null, potentially allowing bugs related to synthetic source recovery to go undetected.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/SourceFieldMapperTests.java-SRC-DELETION-22545-23050-IfStatement","path":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/SourceFieldMapperTests.java","srcDst":"SRC","content":"if (IndexSettings.RECOVERY_USE_SYNTHETIC_SOURCE.isEnabled() \u003d\u003d false) {\n                // TODO: remove this if branch when removing the \u0027index_recovery_use_synthetic_source\u0027 feature flag\n                assertNotNull(doc.rootDoc().getField(\"_recovery_source\"));\n                assertThat(doc.rootDoc().getField(\"_recovery_source\").binaryValue(), equalTo(new BytesRef(\"{\\\"field1\\\":\\\"value1\\\"}\")));\n            } else {\n                assertNull(doc.rootDoc().getField(\"_recovery_source\"));\n            }","nodeType":"DELETION","treeType":"IfStatement","descendantSimpleNames":["isEnabled","assertNotNull","doc","rootDoc","getField","assertThat","doc","rootDoc","getField","binaryValue","equalTo","BytesRef","assertNull","doc","rootDoc","getField"],"startLine":492,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":498,"endLineOffset":13,"length":506,"subs":[{"startLine":492,"startLineOffset":16,"endLine":492,"endLineOffset":80,"length":65},{"startLine":492,"startLineOffset":82,"endLine":496,"endLineOffset":13,"length":343},{"startLine":496,"startLineOffset":19,"endLine":498,"endLineOff